    "text": "<div class=creature>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-title\"><span>{{!!title}}</span><span>2级 游击</span></div>\n<div class=bg-title><span>中型 精界 类人生物</span><span>XP {{!!xp}}</span></div>\n<div><span>''HP'' 39；''重伤'' 19</span><span>''先攻'' +7</span></div>\n<div><span>''AC'' 16，''强韧'' 13，''反射'' 15，''意志'' 13</span><span>''侦查'' +8</span></div>\n<div><span>''速度'' 7</span><span>''感官'' 昏暗视觉</span></div>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-category\">特性</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">战斗优势</div>\n<div class=description>该精灵对任何提供给它战斗优势的生物造成 1d6 额外伤害。</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">荒野步伐</div>\n<div class=description>该精灵快步时无视困难地形。</div>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-category\">标准动作</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">{{$:/dnd/images/meleebasic}}长剑（武器）✦随意</div>\n<div class=description>攻击：近战 1（一个生物）+7vs.AC<br>命中：1d8+6 伤害。</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">{{$:/dnd/images/meleebasic}}短剑（武器）✦随意</div>\n<div class=description>攻击：近战 1（一个生物）+7vs.AC<br>命中：1d6+5 伤害。</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">{{$:/dnd/images/meleebasic}}双武器撕裂✦遭遇</div>\n<div class=description>效果：该精灵对同一个目标使用长剑攻击和短剑攻击。如果两次攻击都命中，则目标受到 4<br>点额外伤害。</div>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-category\">触发动作</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">精灵精准✦遭遇</div>\n<div class=description>触发：该精灵进行一次攻击骰。<br>效果（自由动作）：该精灵重投触发的攻击骰并使用第二次结果。</div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span style=flex-basis:auto>''技能'' 自然+8，隐秘+10</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span>''力量'' 12（+2）</span><span>''敏捷'' 18（+5）</span><span>''感知'' 14（+3）</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span>''体质'' 15（+3）</span><span>''智力'' 10（+1）</span><span>''魅力'' 12（+2）</span></div></div>\n<div><div class=\"ability\"><span>''阵营'' 无</span><span style=flex-basis:auto>''语言'' 通用语，精灵语</span></div></div>\n<div><div class=\"ability\"><span style=flex-basis:auto>''装备'' 革甲，长剑，短剑</span></div></div>\n</div>",
